ja</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Picture / Idol of Lord Satyanarayana</li>\r\n<li>Turmeric Powder - One(1) packet</li>\r\n<li>Kumkum Powder - One(1) packet</li>\r\n<li>Sandal-Wood Paste - Little (if available)</li>\r\n<li>Akshta (Raw Rice Smeared With Turmeric Powder) - in small bowl/cup</li>\r\n<li>Pooja Mandapam - One(1) [if available]</li>\r\n<li>Oil Lamp Stands - Two(2)</li>\r\n<li>A Small Lamp - One(1) [for Aarathi]</li>\r\n<li>Camphor - Little</li>\r\n<li>Incense Sticks - One(1) Packet</li>\r\n<li>Flowers - One Or Two Bunches</li>\r\n<li>Fruits - Five(5) different kinds, Five(5) of each kind, Total 25</li>\r\n<li>Kalasa - One(1) [if available]</li>\r\n<li>One towel and one blouse piece [for Kalasavastra]</li>\r\n<li>Panchamrutam - (Cup of Milk, Curd/Yogurt, Ghee, Honey, and Sugar)</li>\r\n<li>Betel Leaves - 15</li>\r\n<li>Nuts - 20 number, Dry dates - 20</li>\r\n<li>Coconuts - Two (One for Kalasa, One for Lord)</li>\r\n<li>Naivedya Or Prasad - (Kesari Type or any Sweet-Pudding)</li>\r\n<li>Mango Leaves - Few bunches [if available]</li>\r\n<li>Oil - [for Holy Lamp/Deepam]</li>\r\n<li>Cotton Wicks - [for Holy Lamp]</li>\r\n<li>Matchbox - One(1)</li>\r\n<li>Bell - One(1) [if available]</li>\r\n<li>Ghee - One(1) Bottle [for Homam, if available]</li>\r\n<li>Aluminium Trays - Two(2) [for Homam Purpose]</li>\r\n<li>Paper Bowls - Nine(9) [for Nava Dhanyams]</li>\r\n<li>Plates, Vessels, Spoons - Few of each [for Pooja needs]</li>\r\n<li>Paper Towel/Kitchen Napkins - [for Pooja needs]</li>\r\n<li>Scissors - One(1) [to cut flowers and any packets]</li>\r\n<li>Scotch Tape - [if necessary to aid decoration/alankar]</li>\r\n<li>Navadhanyas (Wheat, Rice, Redgram, Greengram, Black Gram, Bengal Gram, Blackeyedpeas, Sesameseeds, Horse Gram)</li>\r\n<li>Dried Wood Chips/Fire Wood and Wood Chips Packet - One(1) (preferably which emit less smoke)</li>\r\n<li>Havan Samagri Powder - One(1) Packet</li>\r\n<li>Tulasi Plant</li>\r\n<li>Comb - One(1)</li>\r\n<li>Bangles - Dozen or more</li>\r\n<li>Saree - One or more</li>\r\n<li>Blouse Piece - One or more</li>\r\n<li>Priest Dakshina</li>\r\n<li>Firewood and wood chips packet - One(1)</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong>NOTE:</strong> If you are doing pooja in the temple, you don&rsquo;t have to bring Kalasam, Mandapam, Oil Lamps, Matchbox, Incense Sticks, Bell, or Lord\'s Photos.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-primary mt-30\">Temple Donation</h3>\r\n<h4>Puja at Temple - $75/-</h4>\r\n<h5>*Priest dakshina separate for both</h5>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<h3 class=\"text-primary mt-30\">Temple Donation</h3>\r\n<h4>Puja at Home - $151/-</h4>\r\n<h5>*Priest dakshina separate for both</h5>','[]',1,0,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,21,'2025-02-01 10:36:59','2025-03-20 23:31:29'),(65,'Grahapravesham','grahapravesham','15','pageview',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'<div class=\"responsive-table text-center\">\r\n<h3 class=\"text-primary mt-30\">Things needed for Puja at home</h3>\r\n<table class=\"custom-table\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>S.no</th>\r\n<th>Item Name</th>\r\n<th>Quantity</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>1</td>\r\n<td>Turmeric Powder</td>\r\n<td>25 grams</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>2</td>\r\n<td>Kumkum Powder</td>\r\n<td>25 grams</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>3</td>\r\n<td>Agarbathi</td>\r\n<td>1 packet</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>4</td>\r\n<td>Sandal Powder</td>\r\n<td>1 packet</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>5</td>\r\n<td>Camphor</td>\r\n<td>1 packet</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>6</td>\r\n<td>Coconut</td>\r\n<td>5 nos</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>7</td>\r\n<td>Rice</td>\r\n<td>5 lbs</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>8</td>\r\n<td>Rice Powder</td>\r\n<td>-</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>9</td>\r\n<td>Betel Leaves</td>\r\n<td>30 nos</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>10</td>\r\n<td>Betel Nuts</td>\r\n<td>30 nos</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>11</td>\r\n<td>Navadhanyam</td>\r\n<td>Available in Indian stores</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>12</td>\r\n<td>Flowers</td>\r\n<td>3 bunches</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr