ety\r\n3 coconuts 7(with water)\r\n4 Prasad Kesari(made of sooji) and anything else (no onion/garlic) -prepared fresh on puja day\r\n5 Panchaamritham mix of milk, yogurt, sugar, honey and ghee in a small cup-prepared fresh on puja day\r\n6 Nava dhaanyam available in a packet in Indian stores\r\n7 beetel leaves(4-6) and nuts in small quantity\r\n8 new blouse piece/Kitchen Hand Towel for offering to Lord\r\n9 Kitchen Hand Towels one\r\n10 Rice(uncooked) 2 lbs\r\n11 Agarbathi 1 packet\r\nAdditional things needed for Puja at home\r\n12 Turmeric and kumkum in small quantities\r\n13 Akshatha uncooked rice mixed with turmeric in a small cup(add 2 drops of ghee for mixing well)\r\n14 Lamp two\r\n15 plate for aarathi to Lord\r\n16 Kalasha(Silver or brass) if you have one, else let the priest know in advance.\r\n17 Sri Satyanarayana Picture (not very small one)\r\n18 Aluminium foils and trays 6 nos\r\nTemple donation for puja service\r\nPuja at temple $61/-\r\nPuja at home $111/-\r\n*Priest dakshina separate for both\r\n“For booking classrooms or social hall for prasadam distribution after private puja, please email -htom.socialhall@gmail.com”.',NULL,NULL,'vidyanagamani@yahoo.com','admin','2014-11-08 02:22:21',NULL,'SCHEDULED','24.252.9.7','2014-11-05 09:03:20','USER','148.159.160.51','2014-11-08 02:22:21','admin',''),(1039,'HTP-1039','2014-11-02','PENDING','PENDING','20141102P1033','$',151.00,'Mantu, Silpi','Baishya','5104 N 140th st',213,'United States',27,'Nebraska','omaha','68164','4026501106','silpisbaishya@yahoo.com','0000-00-00','','','','2014-12-05','09:00:00','10:00:00','0000-00-00','0000-00-00',0,'','','','Namaskar,\r\nI talked to Damodara ji.  He will be out of town on 6th December .   Also he mentioned Full moon is on 5th December.  He.  said we can do in the morning time.  Please let me know.  Thank you\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSilpi S Baishya','ACTIVE','silpi s baishya',1035,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'CHANGED','98.161