02:21:25',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(1014,'20141119TT1014','Ralston Middle School-7th Grade','2014-12-03','16:00:00','0000-00-00','00:00:00','jacalyn_groesser@ralstonschools.org','4028713725',0,'12, 13',0,'','My name is Jacki Groesser, a World History Teacher at Ralston Middle School.  We brought a group of kids here last year and really enjoyed it, and would like to schedule a trip there again.  We would like to come on Wed. Dec.3rd, if possible, but need to get this verified so we can get permission slips sent home.  Please contact me as soon as possible.  Thanks so much!',1,'ACTIVE',0,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'','',NULL,'PENDING','204.234.218.214','2014-11-19 21:53:04',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(1015,'20141129TT1015','Cheyenne','2014-11-29','14:00:00','2014-11-30','12:00:00','Cheffe01@wsc.edu','4027404882',2,'',0,'','Contact by email please. Touring for a school project. Thank you',1,'ACTIVE',0,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'','',NULL,'PENDING','98.168.230.130','2014-11-29 00:29:57',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(1016,'20141129TT1016','Cheyenne','2014-11-29','14:00:00','2014-11-30','12:00:00','Cheffe01@wsc.edu','4027404882',2,'',0,'','Contact by email. Touring for school project. Thank you',1,'ACTIVE',0,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'','',NULL,'PENDING','70.197.225.231','2014-11-29 00:33:56',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(1017,'20141212TT1017','Montessori','2015-04-16','10:00:00','2015-04-23','09:00:00','director@millardmontessori.com','402-502-9118',55,'pre-school, kindergarten aged children',0,'','We are studying Asian cultures next semester and would very much appreciate the opportunity to come and visit the Hindu Temple in Omaha. We have 50 students and would be able to bring 5 staff members plus as many parent volunteers as you would like. We are able to come and visit anytime between 9:00 AM - 11:00 AM. We look forward to hearing back from you.',1,'ACTIVE',0,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'','',NULL,'PENDING','98.190.178.189','2014-12-12 01:24:33',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(1018,'20141212TT1018','Creighton University world religions class: Dr Wendy Wright','2015-01-24','10:00:00','2015-01-31','09:00:00','wmwright@creighton.edu','402 681 0338',10,'college students',0,'','My Creighton students have really benefited in the past from being able to visit the temple. It is a wonderful service to the wider community. I am hoping that this will be possible in January 2015. Saturday morning either 9 am or 10 am probably works best for most students. \r\nDr Wendy Wright',1,'ACTIVE',0,'2015-01-24','10:00:00','Dr. Sanjay Singh','Thank you for your request. We confirm the tour for your group for Sat. Jan 24th at 10:00 am','','admin','2015-01-16 08:24:37','SCHEDULED','147.134.212.15','2014-12-12 23:37:11',NULL,'68.13.110.140','2015-01-16 08:24:37','admin'),(1019,'20141216TT1019','Messiah Lutheran Church Middle School Class','2015-01-25','09:00:00','2015-02-01','09:00:00','greg@messiahfamily.com','402-331-5510',20,'12,60',1,'2013','This is our confirmation class and their adult guides - 13 children ages 12-14 and 6 adults. We are studying our neighbor\\\'s\\\' faith. We have visited in prior years and would love to bring this group. The contact is Pastor Greg Berger at the above email or phone. I marked accepting the terms and conditions, but the page was blank.',1,'ACTIVE',0,'2015-01-25','09:00:00','Mr. Jayaram','We confirm your request for Jan 25th at 9:00 am. Thank you.','','admin','2015-01-16 08:51:18','SCHEDULED','70.184.213.238','2014-12-16 20:20:44',NULL,'68.13.110.140','2015-01-16 08:51:18','admin'),(1020,'20141223TT1020','Inzauro','2014-12-27','12:00:00','2014-12-28','12:00:00','humanist_yoga@outlook.com','4026705597',2,'20 & 50',0,'','',1,'ACTIVE',0,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'','',NULL,'PENDING','173.209.211.144','2014-12-23 03:21:08',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(1021,'20141230TT1021','Religious Study Class, UNO','2015-02-24','19:00:00','2015-03-03','18:00:00','praval@unomaha.edu','4024450590',8,'18-22',0,'','Hindu Religion class at UNO would like to visit HIndu Temple as a part of curriculum to learn about Hindu deities, religion, festivals and related information.  We would like to visit Tuesday evenings, preferably on Feb. 25 or March 3rd, 2015.  Please contact me. at 4.02-445-0590 or 402-515-1714.\r\nThank you.\r\nPrafulla Raval',1,'ACTIVE',0,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'','',NULL,'PENDING','98.161.34.6','2014-12-30 02:53:24',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(1022,'20141230TT1022','Religious Study Class, UNO','2015-02-24','19:00:00','2015-03-03','18:00:00','praval@unomaha.edu','4024450590',8,'18-22',0,'','Hindu Religion class at UNO would like to visit HIndu Temple as a part of curriculum to learn about Hindu deities, religion, festivals and related information.  We would like to visit Tuesday evenings, preferably on Feb. 24or March 3rd, 2015.  Please contact me. at 4.02-445-0590 or 402-515-1714.\r\nThank you.\r\nPrafulla Raval',1,'ACTIVE',0,'2015-03-03','18:00:00','Ninaji','','','admin','2015-01-16 08:28:51','SCHEDULED','98.161.34.6','2014-12-30 02:55:50',NULL,'68.13.110.140','2015-01-16 08:28:51','admin'),(1023,'20150107TT1023','Kathy O\\\'Keefe/Creighton Prep World Religions class','2015-02-18','11:00:00','2015-02-16','11:00:00','kokee@prep.creighton.edu','402-215-5893',68,'65 12th grade students, 3 teacher/chaperones',1,'September/October 2014','Ideally we would want to visit from 11:30-12:30 but that was not an option above.  \r\nAlso, I clicked on the \\\"terms and conditions\\\" link below but nothing appeared.  Please let me know of any concerns or terms that you have that I might not know of.  Thank you.',1,'ACTIVE',0,'2015-02-18','11:00:00','Vandana Singh','Kathy,\r\nI can do the tour on Feb18th at 11:00 am.\r\nThanks,\r\nVandana','','admin','2015-01-16 08:04:23','SCHEDULED','72.198.196.164','2015-01-07 22:54:33',NULL,'68.13.110.140','2015-01-16 08:04:23','admin'),(1024,'20150112TT1024','First-Plymouth Church','2015-02-15','10:00:00','2015-02-08','10:00:00','mitch@firstplymouth.org','402-440-3522',40,'8th grade Youth',1,'Feb. 2014','',1,'ACTIVE',0,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'','',NULL,'PEND