tive.',1,'ACTIVE',0,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'','',NULL,'PENDING','69.63.107.90','2020-02-11 23:53:28',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(1257,'20200302TT1257','Jennifer Gilbert','2020-03-06','18:00:00','2020-03-13','14:00:00','jennygilbert21@gmail.com','4023202417',2,'20, 22',0,'','Hello! My name is Jennifer Gilbert and I am a student at University of Nebraska-Lincoln. I am in a class this semester that is dedicated to telling the story of \"Climate Change in Nebraska\" and my personal focus is on the \"impact of religion\". I have been trying to connect with and interview as many religious leaders as possible to get a broad view of this complex issue. \r\n\r\nI am reaching out to see if there is a spokesperson at the Temple that would be interested in setting up an interview with me. As the only Hindu Temple in Nebraska, I would love to get your \"point of view\" on how climate change is impacting this specific community.\r\n\r\nIf possible, it would be great to set up a tour and interview at the same time? If meeting in person is not possible for an interview, I would love to set up a phone interview. \r\n\r\nThank you in advance for your help. I appreciate any contribution to my story and I look forward to hearing back from you soon.',1,'ACTIVE',0,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'','',NULL,'PENDING','129.93.184.81','2020-03-02 08:18:25',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(1258,'20200309TT1258','World Religions Class / Iowa Western Community College','2020-04-30','14:00:00','2020-04-23','14:00:00','mashman@iwcc.edu','7123253462',20,'18 , 38',0,'','I am Matthew Ashman, the instructor for the course, \"Survey of World Religions\" at Iowa Western Community College. Students in that course have done some study of Hinduism and would like to tour the temple to learn more outside the classroom and in their own communities. \r\n\r\nIf the proposed times are not ideal or would not work, we can be more flexible with both dates and times. We are normally available Tues. or Thurs. 4/2 - 4/30, but alternate availability in April may also be possible.\r\n\r\nAlthough I am frequently away from my desk during the day to teach class, I can normally be reached 11-12 at my office phone, 712-325-3462. \r\n\r\nI very much look forward to hearing from you! Thank you. \r\n\r\nMatthew\r\n\r\n--\r\nMatthew Ashman, Ph.D.\r\nInstructor of Philosophy  |  Communication & Fine Arts\r\nStuart Hall 1134   |  mashman@iwcc.edu  |  712-325-3462',1,'ACTIVE',0,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'','',NULL,'PENDING','209.56.12.13','2020-03-09 17:03:56',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(1259,'20200311TT1259','Emily Clemens','2020-03-20','17:00:00','2020-03-27','17:00:00','emilyclemens210@gmail.com','4029603534',5,'20-25',0,'','College of Saint Mary students, we are flexible on times as well!',1,'ACTIVE',0,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'','',NULL,'PENDING','68.13.150.127','2020-03-11 03:39:54',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(1260,'20200715TT1260','Spirituality & Social Work','2020-07-22','18:00:00','2020-07-29','19:00:00','pszto@unomaha.edu','402-212-4693',18,'20-60',1,'Spring 2015','I teach a course on Spirituality & Social Work at UNO. I want the students to learn about Hindu spirituality. Thank you - Dr. Szto',1,'ACTIVE',0,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'','',NULL,'PENDING','184.97.139.196','2020-07-15 00:38:55',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(1261,'20200830TT1261','Rawat Family','2020-08-30','14:00:00','2020-08-30','14:00:00','nitinrawat30@gmail.com','4028131892',4,'40,33,8,1',0,'','Want Darshan',1,'ACTIVE',0,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,'','',NULL,'PENDING','68.13.98.36','2020-08-30 22:04:14',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL),(1262,'20200924TT1262','Creighton Grief & Loss Class','2020-10-27','16:00:00','0000-00-00','17:00:00','cathyfox@creighton.edu','6053915408',0,'18-22',0,'','Hello,\r\n\r\nI am currently teaching a grief & loss class at Creighton University, during which I am planning a class period for the students to learn about various cultures\' and religions\' beliefs and practices related to death and grief. Due to COVID, we are unable to come for a tour, but I was hoping that there might be 